<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="705376"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537267115"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="irony"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ClariS"/><amll:meta key="album" value="irony (期間生産限定盤)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:19.960"><div begin="00:00.020" end="03:57.406"><p begin="00:00.020" end="00:04.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">そんな優しくしないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要对我这么温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ya sa shi ku shi na i de</span></p><p begin="00:04.225" end="00:07.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">どんな顔すればいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要我该怎么面对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ka o su re ba i i no</span></p><p begin="00:07.695" end="00:12.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">積み重ねた言葉で見えないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直对你冷眼相待的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi ka sa ne ta ko to ba de mi e na i yo</span></p><p begin="00:12.691" end="00:15.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">君の横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经看不清楚你的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="00:29.775" end="00:32.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">どこだっけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到底在哪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko da 'k ke</span></p><p begin="00:32.152" end="00:36.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">無くした鍵は見つからないままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丢失的钥匙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi ta ka gi wa</span></p><p begin="00:36.861" end="00:39.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ため息<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叹一口气 又和你彼此错过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me i ki su re chi ga i ni</span></p><p begin="00:39.323" end="00:43.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">すれ違いに意地はって疲れちゃう</p><p begin="00:43.937" end="00:50.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">ほんの少し遠く 手は届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次稍微远了一点 我就难以触及</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n no su ko shi to o ku te wa to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="00:50.448" end="00:54.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">ちゃんと掴みたいのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己是否真想挽留</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cha n to tsu ka mi ta i no ka na</span></p><p begin="00:54.016" end="00:57.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">君のその影<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的那道身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no so no ka ge</span></p><p begin="00:57.990" end="01:01.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">そんな優しくしないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要对我这么温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ya sa shi ku shi na i de</span></p><p begin="01:01.336" end="01:04.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">ほら また傷つけあって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不然又会伤害彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ma ta ki zu tsu ke a 't te</span></p><p begin="01:04.957" end="01:07.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">積み重ねた嘘で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直口是心非的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi ka sa ne ta u so de</span></p><p begin="01:07.963" end="01:12.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">動けなくなってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经手足无措</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u u go ke na ku na 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:12.169" end="01:15.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">そんな目で見つめないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要这样地看着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na me de mi tsu me na i de</span></p><p begin="01:15.715" end="01:19.066" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">どんな顔すればいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要我该怎么面对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ka o su re ba i i no</span></p><p begin="01:19.066" end="01:22.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">迷ってばっかだけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今满心迷茫的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo 't te ba 'k ka da ke re do</span></p><p begin="01:22.780" end="01:27.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">いつかは 笑えるのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否总有一天能够对你流露笑颜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka wa wa ra e ru no ka na</span></p><p begin="01:41.196" end="01:44.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">いくつの日々を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回首往昔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku tsu no hi bi wo</span></p><p begin="01:44.683" end="01:48.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">君と過ごしてきたんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们已经相伴多少时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to su go shi te ki ta n da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:48.356" end="01:53.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">それでも交わした言葉は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是彼此交谈的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ka wa shi ta ko to ba wa</span></p><p begin="01:53.205" end="01:55.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">少なすぎるね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却屈指可数</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku na su gi ru ne</span></p><p begin="01:55.918" end="02:02.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">ほんの少し近く 君との距離が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今稍微近了一些 我和你的距离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n no su ko shi chi ka ku ki mi to no kyo ri ga</span></p><p begin="02:02.152" end="02:05.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">うまくつかめないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却抓不住你的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku tsu ka me na i n da</span></p><p begin="02:05.622" end="02:08.572" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">あとちょっとなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明只差一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to cho 't to na no ni</span></p><p begin="02:09.737" end="02:12.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">そんな優しくしないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要对我这么温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ya sa shi ku shi na i de</span></p><p begin="02:12.779" end="02:16.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">ほら また傷つけあって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不然又会伤害彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ma ta ki zu tsu ke a 't te</span></p><p begin="02:16.388" end="02:21.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">積み重ねた嘘で聞こえないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直对你口是心非的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi ka sa ne ta u so de ki ko e na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:21.674" end="02:23.405" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">君の言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经听不清楚你的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to ba</span></p><p begin="02:23.405" end="02:27.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">本当の声を隠して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">藏起自己真正的心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko e wo ka ku shi te</span></p><p begin="02:27.211" end="02:30.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">口ずさむこのメロディ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哼着此刻这首旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku chi zu sa mu ko no me ro di</span></p><p begin="02:30.511" end="02:36.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">ゆっくりと変わっていく心に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听凭这颗渐渐开始改变的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu 'k ku ri to ka wa 't te ku ko ko ro ni</span></p><p begin="02:36.029" end="02:38.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">身を任せて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我渐渐向你走近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi wo ma ka se te</span></p><p begin="02:52.866" end="03:00.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">自分のことなんてわからないし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不太明白自己的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no ko to na n te wa ka ra na i shi</span></p><p begin="03:00.189" end="03:07.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">君のこと知りたい気もするけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也好想更多地了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to shi ri ta i ki mo su ru ke do</span></p><p begin="03:07.253" end="03:14.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ぶつかる気持ちを少し抑えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何不按捺彼此碰撞的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu tsu ka ru ki mo chi wo su ko shi o sa e te</span></p><p begin="03:14.406" end="03:21.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">見えない壁 手探りで探すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一同摸索那看不见的隔阂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i ka be te sa gu ri de sa ga su yo</span></p><p begin="03:28.165" end="03:31.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">そんな優しくしないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要对我这么温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ya sa shi ku shi na i de</span></p><p begin="03:31.817" end="03:35.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">ほら また傷つけあって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不然又会伤害彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ma ta ki zu tsu ke a 't te</span></p><p begin="03:35.436" end="03:38.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">積み重ねた嘘は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直口是心非的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi ka sa ne ta u so wa</span></p><p begin="03:38.241" end="03:42.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">もう辛いだけだからね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经苦不堪言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u tsu ra i da ke da ka ra ne</span></p><p begin="03:42.338" end="03:46.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">すぐに会いに行きたいけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明好想马上见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu ni a i ni i ki ta i ke do</span></p><p begin="03:46.054" end="03:49.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">言葉は見つからないし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却又不知如何开口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba wa mi tsu ka ra na i shi</span></p><p begin="03:49.507" end="03:54.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">最後の一ページくらい君には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望自己至少在故事的最后一页</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no i chi pe e ji ku ra i ki mi ni wa</span></p><p begin="03:54.859" end="03:57.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">笑顔見せたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够对你展现笑颜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga o mi se ta i</span></p></div></body></tt>